{"id":1120803,"name":"크리스티나·심문 III","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"크리스티나·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1120803]}],"trial":{"trial_id":120803,"stage":"3단계","unlock_time":"2023-10-27 14:00:00","diary1":"당신들은 고양이를 데리고 급히 치안국으로 갔다. 보안관에게 사건을 상황을 보고하고, 헨리를 구할 수 있도록 지원을 요청하기 위해서였다.","diary2":"복잡다난하고 회색빛으로 가득한 이 세상에는 주변 사람이 보기에는 조금 천진난만하지만, 정의를 굳게 믿는 이상주의자가 필요하다. 바로 크리스티나 같은 사람 말이다.\n　　명탐정과 조수는 그들이 굳게 믿는 정의의 길에서 흔들림 없이 꿋꿋하게 나아갈 것이다.","evidence":[{"ID":260445,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260446,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":220803023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dial